":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"kpvyVkEnSNMjfvsDcuCF-g","review_id":"ecsrqkRNcRdXNNqjoRcsrg","date":"2011-05-31T19:31:55","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9216513633728027,"text_excerpt":"Located on Hayne blvd. in New Orleans East in which I Love, Love, Love the ambiance, very jazzy and cultural! Not to mention the food is exceptional, kudos to the chef.. The Turkey bugers are my fav which come loaded on a sweet bun with a serving of robust fries to enjoy! The lemon drop Martini's are commendable! Nice Happy Hour spot with an upstairs for clubbing. The brunch is between 1p and 3p and Soul in the City is coming on friday nights! Give it a try and let's help put New Orleans East back on the Map!!!"},{"business_id":"kpvyVkEnSNMjfvsDcuCF-g","review_id":"GCYrqpTkn5nfw8rr0F_iRA","date":"2012-01-24T05:03:53","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.910407543182373,"text_excerpt":"This is a pretty good place! If you want to eat some great tasting food you should try this place! I enjoyed it. If you are into the club scene, it is pretty cool! YOU WONT GET SHOT lol because it is for the grown and sexy :) The price for a drink is sort of high (in my opinion but im not used to buying my own and I paid like 7 bucks (equal to about 9 in Cali)for some grey goose on the rocks\") but its not ghetto and the help is pretty friendly."},{"business_id":"kpvyVkEnSNMjfvsDcuCF-g","review_id":"XIFnKa5FKJupgLI3n9RtMA","date":"2011-10-05T02:54:17","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.8975844979286194,"text_excerpt":"Just when you think the East only has fast food and mom and pop spots here come Dish on Hayne! Dish on Hayne gives us yet another LOCAL eatery in an area that is rebuilding so quickly. I have had many opportunites to eat @ the Dish and every daily special has been consistently delicious as well as offering spins on traditional dishes. This place will make you keep going back for more! Memorable meals I have had here are the Shrimp n Grits, Crab Cake Salad, and heck ANYTHING on the menu is sure to please the palate. Presentation is awesome, staff is friendly atmosphere makes you think you are at a jazzy joint in the heart of the city and not out in the East. It is a must try if you haven't..."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
